{"id":"303ea9f3c70914f9","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md","title":"Language Expanded by Named Constants","display":"df-language-with-constants — Language Expanded by Named Constants","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-language-with-constants","aliases":["58-df-language-with-constants","Language with Named Constants"],"display":"df-language-with-constants — Language Expanded by Named Constants","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-language-with-constants"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-language-with-constants</span><span>Language with Named Constants</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-language-with-constants — Language Expanded by Named Constants"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,L_B,B,c,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M_B\\in V\">\\(L,L_B,B,c,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M_B\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Signatures use the syntax tuple\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\">\\(L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\)</span> from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>.</li>\n<li>For this tuple, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Cst}=C\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Cst}=C\\)</span>,\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\{f\\in F:a_F(f)=n\\}\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\{f\\in F:a_F(f)=n\\}\\)</span>, and\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n=\\{r\\in R:a_R(r)=n\\}\">\\(L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n=\\{r\\in R:a_R(r)=n\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span> are from the cited dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span> and the interpretation-map tags <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cst}\">\\(\\mathrm{cst}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{fun}\">\\(\\mathrm{fun}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{rel}\">\\(\\mathrm{rel}\\)</span> use the conventions of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}constants}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_F,F,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_R,R,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,B,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\\forall b,b&#39;\\in B\\;(c(b)=c(b&#39;)\\to b=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\cap\n(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land L_B=\n\\langle C\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(c),F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}constants}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_F,F,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_R,R,\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,B,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\\forall b,b&#39;\\in B\\;(c(b)=c(b&#39;)\\to b=b&#39;)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\cap\n(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land L_B=\n\\langle C\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(c),F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}named\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S(\\mathcal M_B,\\mathcal M,L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_B,L_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_B)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Cst}\n=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\nI_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}(c(b))=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}named\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S(\\mathcal M_B,\\mathcal M,L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_B,L_B)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_B)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Cst}\n=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\nI_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}(c(b))=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The injection <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> is explicit, so each new constant has a unique named parameter and cannot collide with an old symbol or variable.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S\\)</span> fixes the interpretations of all old symbols and interprets <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c(b)\">\\(c(b)\\)</span> as <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span>; it is stronger than merely asserting that the two carriers coincide.</li>\n<li>This reusable upstream definition is shared by model-theoretic types and complete atomic diagrams.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"Signatures use the syntax tuple\n$L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle$ from [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Univ}$ and the interpretation-map tags $\\mathrm{cst}$, $\\mathrm{fun}$, and $\\mathrm{rel}$ use the conventions of [[../batch18/58-df-structure.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L,L_B,B,c,\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"L=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"L.\\mathrm{Cst}=C","display":false},{"tex":"L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n=\\{f\\in F:a_F(f)=n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n=\\{r\\in R:a_R(r)=n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Struct}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Univ}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cst}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{fun}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{rel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}language\\text{-}with\\text{-}constants}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\nL=\\langle C,F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\\\\\n&{}\\land C\\cap F=C\\cap R=F\\cap R=\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_F,F,\\omega)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(a_R,R,\\omega)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\mathrm{Function}(c,B,\\operatorname{ran}(c))\n\\land\\forall b,b'\\in B\\;(c(b)=c(b')\\to b=b')\\\\\n&{}\\land\\operatorname{ran}(c)\\cap\n(C\\cup F\\cup R\\cup\\mathrm{Var}_S)=\\varnothing\\\\\n&{}\\land L_B=\n\\langle C\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(c),F,a_F,R,a_R\\rangle\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}named\\text{-}expansion}\\vdash{}&\n\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S(\\mathcal M_B,\\mathcal M,L_B,L,B,c)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S(L_B,L,B,c)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\n\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M_B,L_B)\\\\\n&{}\\land B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\n\\land\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M_B)=\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\\\\n&{}\\land I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Cst}\n=I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M}\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\nI_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Fun}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{fun},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\land\nI_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M_B}\\upharpoonright L.\\mathrm{Rel}_n\n=I_{\\mathrm{rel},n}^{\\mathcal M}\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall b\\in B\\;\n\\bigl(I_{\\mathrm{cst}}^{\\mathcal M_B}(c(b))=b\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"c(b)","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false}],"bytes":2975,"backlinks":[{"id":"c8dfa3853919882a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S$ and $\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S$ are from [[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]."},{"id":"d90ddd4e02e45f78","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NamedExpansion}_S$ is from [[58-df-language-with-constants.md]]."},{"id":"5410a5b39300442c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"74518fe8da772d53","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{LanguageWithConstants}_S$ (named-language predicate from [[../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-language-with-constants]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-757","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-language-with-constants.md|58-df-language-with-constants]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093","36d7463d215be751","d9b8711cda3f31ca"]}